WEBVTT

01:40.180 --> 01:44.800
=Love Story in the 1970s=

01:45.100 --> 01:47.940
=Episode 12=

01:48.026 --> 01:50.071
(Jiangcheng No. 2 Guesthouse)
I just want to go

01:50.170 --> 01:51.810
on my parents' behalf,
not as his sister.

01:57.493 --> 01:58.980
I'm going to the washroom to wash up.

02:00.080 --> 02:01.780
Don't you think we're kind of awkward?

02:05.290 --> 02:06.620
We're married,

02:06.620 --> 02:08.090
yet we sleep in separate rooms.

02:08.370 --> 02:09.180
Isn't that

02:09.180 --> 02:10.430
wasting money

02:10.660 --> 02:12.000
and national resources?

02:13.560 --> 02:14.690
If you're willing,

02:15.120 --> 02:16.130
you can move into my room.

02:17.530 --> 02:19.400
Why don't you move into

02:19.400 --> 02:21.020
mine instead?

02:21.200 --> 02:22.620
Because Jiangcheng is my hometown.

02:22.990 --> 02:23.940
You came to Jiangcheng,

02:23.960 --> 02:25.500
so naturally you should stay in my room.

02:25.570 --> 02:27.410
Mine has a bathroom.
It's more convenient.

02:27.410 --> 02:28.620
I don't get up at night.

02:30.626 --> 02:32.220
I'll leave the door open until 11 PM.

02:32.271 --> 02:33.370
After that, I'm sleeping.

02:33.970 --> 02:35.980
I'll leave my door open
until 10:30 PM.

02:36.900 --> 02:38.140
(Silence)

02:38.480 --> 02:39.690
After that, I'm sleeping.

03:03.970 --> 03:05.970
What are you so happy about?

03:06.970 --> 03:07.740
Nothing.

03:09.410 --> 03:11.130
The training program gave out a subsidy?

03:11.340 --> 03:12.690
I haven't been a month.

03:12.690 --> 03:13.940
It's not that fast.

03:14.370 --> 03:15.940
Did you find money?

03:16.130 --> 03:16.940
Other than money,

03:16.940 --> 03:18.648
what else could possibly make you happy?

03:19.300 --> 03:20.650
Getting into college.

03:20.650 --> 03:21.782
My brother getting married.

03:21.900 --> 03:22.690
What else?

03:23.570 --> 03:24.370
And?

03:26.530 --> 03:27.130
Forget it.

03:27.360 --> 03:28.300
You don't need to think.

03:28.404 --> 03:29.693
As long as I think of it.

03:31.410 --> 03:32.370
What's it?

03:34.020 --> 03:35.900
Can you wear a dress to work tomorrow?

03:40.500 --> 03:41.300
I want to see.

03:43.300 --> 03:44.810
I'm not wearing a dress.

03:44.810 --> 03:47.180
It's too flashy.

03:47.340 --> 03:49.090
You don't even work at the factory.

03:49.090 --> 03:50.382
Why should I wear a dress?

03:51.220 --> 03:52.370
Why do you even care?

03:58.690 --> 03:59.570
I made your bed.

04:27.210 --> 04:28.210
It's past 11 PM.

04:28.540 --> 04:29.280
I'm sleeping.

04:31.293 --> 04:33.350
My watch says
there are still fifteen seconds left.

04:34.250 --> 04:35.260
Your watch is wrong.

04:52.860 --> 04:56.660
(Controlled Quality, Consistent Supply,
Strong Management, High Productivity)

04:58.570 --> 05:00.710
Fei Ni, when's your next night shift?

05:00.770 --> 05:01.890
I'm still arranging it.

05:02.182 --> 05:03.010
That's exhausting.

05:03.010 --> 05:04.570
I don't like night shifts either.

05:04.570 --> 05:05.130
Fei Ni.

05:05.471 --> 05:06.560
- Fei Ni.
- I'm leaving first.

05:06.560 --> 05:07.048
Mm.

05:08.130 --> 05:08.890
Hey.

05:08.890 --> 05:10.890
You look pretty today.

05:10.890 --> 05:12.010
- Your dress.
- Fei Ni.

05:12.010 --> 05:12.480
I...

05:15.500 --> 05:16.500
Fang,

05:17.330 --> 05:18.910
you look sharp today, too.

05:19.110 --> 05:19.780
So handsome,

05:19.780 --> 05:20.890
young lad.

05:22.620 --> 05:24.770
Are you two going out for something fun

05:24.970 --> 05:26.100
after work?

05:26.980 --> 05:27.630
No.

05:28.570 --> 05:29.700
Getting shy now?

05:29.700 --> 05:30.804
Alright. I won't tease you.

05:30.810 --> 05:32.420
Well, you two carry on.

05:32.420 --> 05:33.180
I'm off to eat.

05:40.893 --> 05:42.500
Who did you borrow those clothes from?

05:42.500 --> 05:44.570
Look, the sleeves are short.

05:45.100 --> 05:46.500
Is there any newspaper event?

05:46.980 --> 05:47.770
Handsome, right?

05:48.370 --> 05:49.200
Not bad.

05:49.515 --> 05:50.270
Why are you here?

05:53.010 --> 05:53.810
For free food.

06:09.500 --> 06:10.100
Sorry,

06:10.100 --> 06:10.937
this seat is taken.

06:10.980 --> 06:11.570
Okay.

06:14.370 --> 06:15.690
Why did you chase him off?

06:15.690 --> 06:16.804
There are plenty of seats.

06:18.010 --> 06:18.890
Someone's coming soon.

06:19.740 --> 06:20.570
Who?

06:23.330 --> 06:24.620
Dad, Mom.

06:28.540 --> 06:31.010
Why are you here?

06:31.010 --> 06:32.540
Ask your husband and Ting.

06:32.620 --> 06:33.810
This is huge,

06:33.810 --> 06:35.890
and these two kept it so secret.

06:36.010 --> 06:37.570
I just found out this morning.

06:37.570 --> 06:39.271
I didn't have time to prepare anything.

06:39.570 --> 06:40.620
Your brother

06:40.620 --> 06:42.010
can never hide anything.

06:42.010 --> 06:43.404
He always shows it on his face.

06:43.404 --> 06:43.980
But this time,

06:43.980 --> 06:45.420
he kept it quiet for so long.

06:47.130 --> 06:47.940
Here.

06:48.810 --> 06:50.330
I saved this especially for you.

06:50.370 --> 06:51.582
I was going to give it to you

06:51.604 --> 06:53.380
when we visited your new house.

06:53.740 --> 06:54.950
Since it's your wedding today.

06:55.420 --> 06:56.240
Happy wedding.

06:57.770 --> 06:59.680
Whose wedding?

07:00.010 --> 07:00.880
Our wedding.

07:07.660 --> 07:08.493
(To Serve the People)

07:08.537 --> 07:10.260
- Ms. Xu.
- Ms. Xu.

07:11.420 --> 07:12.370
Ms. Xu.

07:12.370 --> 07:14.130
- Ms. Xu.
- Ms. Xu.

07:18.370 --> 07:19.810
Comrades,

07:20.330 --> 07:21.420
workers.

07:22.010 --> 07:23.330
Quiet down, please.

07:23.420 --> 07:24.620
Today,

07:24.620 --> 07:26.420
I'm very honored

07:26.420 --> 07:27.379
to have been invited

07:27.380 --> 07:29.770
to serve as the host for the wedding
of Fei Ni of our factory

07:29.770 --> 07:31.330
and life-saving hero,

07:31.330 --> 07:34.690
Fang Muyang.

07:34.770 --> 07:37.890
With a warm round of applause,

07:38.330 --> 07:40.320
let's welcome the newlyweds

07:40.660 --> 07:41.890
to the stage.

07:42.100 --> 07:47.060
- Excellent!
- Excellent!

07:47.180 --> 07:47.790
Go on.

07:48.010 --> 07:48.630
Come on.

07:56.100 --> 07:56.880
Good.

07:58.690 --> 07:59.980
Fang Muyang

07:59.980 --> 08:02.890
is well-known as a hero.

08:03.330 --> 08:04.690
And Fei Ni

08:05.250 --> 08:06.370
is an outstanding worker

08:06.370 --> 08:08.210
of Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory.

08:08.740 --> 08:09.370
Today,

08:09.810 --> 08:11.910
under the attention of factory leaders

08:12.540 --> 08:15.330
and the blessings of all coworkers,

08:15.620 --> 08:18.570
they are now husband and wife.

08:18.915 --> 08:20.860
On behalf
of Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory,

08:21.370 --> 08:24.370
I offer you
our sincerest congratulations.

08:24.740 --> 08:27.250
- Good!
- Good!

08:32.300 --> 08:33.210
Good!

08:33.540 --> 08:34.330
Good!

08:38.260 --> 08:38.900
Captain,

08:39.610 --> 08:40.570
they're getting married.

09:05.730 --> 09:07.120
Well done, Fei Ting.

09:07.380 --> 09:08.570
Neat knife work.

09:08.710 --> 09:10.470
When I was in
the Great Northern Wilderness,

09:10.471 --> 09:12.550
I had to cook for myself.
That's how I picked it up.

09:15.540 --> 09:16.210
Mr. Li,

09:16.604 --> 09:18.115
thank you for all your hard work

09:18.115 --> 09:19.210
for my sister's wedding.

09:19.490 --> 09:20.970
Oh, come on. Don't be so polite.

09:20.970 --> 09:22.315
I'm not the one who worked hard.

09:22.315 --> 09:23.260
Your brother-in-law did.

09:23.260 --> 09:24.360
He brought all these fish.

09:25.570 --> 09:26.690
Your sister has keen eyes

09:26.690 --> 09:27.570
for the right man.

09:28.970 --> 09:29.780
Up next,

09:29.780 --> 09:30.570
let's invite

09:30.570 --> 09:33.330
the family members
of Fei Ni and Fang Muyang

09:33.330 --> 09:34.140
on stage.

09:34.420 --> 09:37.850
- Good!
- Good!

09:41.380 --> 09:42.730
Now,

09:42.730 --> 09:44.570
let's hear a few words

09:44.570 --> 09:45.570
from Fei Ni's family.

09:46.380 --> 09:47.490
You go.

09:47.900 --> 09:49.140
Come on. You speak.

09:49.380 --> 09:50.380
You speak.

09:50.380 --> 09:51.180
Fine, I'll speak.

09:58.540 --> 10:03.610
- Excellent!
- Excellent!

10:04.880 --> 10:05.680
Today

10:06.210 --> 10:07.810
is a big day.

10:09.280 --> 10:10.570
Fang Muyang

10:10.570 --> 10:12.420
is not only a hero,

10:12.420 --> 10:16.020
but also a man of refined character.

10:16.180 --> 10:16.970
Hence,

10:17.210 --> 10:18.800
I sincerely wish

10:19.250 --> 10:21.570
both Fang Muyang and Fei Ni

10:21.690 --> 10:22.930
to walk side by side

10:23.140 --> 10:26.340
on the great path of socialism

10:27.500 --> 10:28.180
and soon

10:28.420 --> 10:29.690
give us

10:29.690 --> 10:31.900
a successor to the socialist cause.

10:31.900 --> 10:36.880
- Well said!
- Well said!

10:37.180 --> 10:38.660
Good!

10:39.420 --> 10:40.810
As for Fang Muyang,

10:41.210 --> 10:43.020
due to special circumstances,

10:43.020 --> 10:45.380
his family couldn't attend in person.

10:45.540 --> 10:47.020
But it's fine.

10:47.300 --> 10:49.900
We're all his family.

10:52.810 --> 10:53.610
Sorry,

10:54.210 --> 10:54.850
we're late.

10:56.780 --> 10:57.850
Who are they?

10:58.450 --> 10:59.780
Never seen them before.

11:00.000 --> 11:01.020
Yeah, who are they?

11:01.293 --> 11:02.582
They're not from our factory.

11:10.580 --> 11:12.540
You wouldn't want regrets

11:12.671 --> 11:14.226
at your brother's wedding, right?

11:29.570 --> 11:30.400
Hello, everyone.

11:30.570 --> 11:31.570
I'm Fang Mujing,

11:31.920 --> 11:33.090
Fang Muyang's sister.

11:34.140 --> 11:35.090
This is

11:36.180 --> 11:37.210
my husband, Qu Hua.

11:37.900 --> 11:38.610
Hello, everyone.

11:39.210 --> 11:40.850
I'm Fang Muyang's brother-in-law,

11:40.850 --> 11:41.380
Qu Hua.

11:42.080 --> 11:42.940
I'm a doctor.

11:43.540 --> 11:45.610
I come from a military family.

11:46.204 --> 11:48.137
My grandfather served in the Red Army,

11:48.182 --> 11:49.493
and my father

11:49.537 --> 11:50.940
fought in the Korean War.

11:51.780 --> 11:52.840
That's good!

11:54.810 --> 11:55.900
I'm very happy

11:56.210 --> 11:57.490
and honored

11:57.780 --> 11:59.610
to marry Fang Muyang's sister,

11:59.610 --> 12:01.330
Fang Mujing.

12:03.180 --> 12:05.220
I welcome Fei Ni

12:05.280 --> 12:06.700
into our big family.

12:07.170 --> 12:07.900
From now on,

12:08.380 --> 12:09.570
our family

12:09.750 --> 12:11.210
will work even harder

12:11.210 --> 12:12.570
to contribute

12:12.730 --> 12:13.920
to socialist construction.

12:13.920 --> 12:15.960
Well said!

12:16.410 --> 12:17.260
Welcome!

12:18.180 --> 12:19.340
Welcome!

12:19.450 --> 12:21.300
Now, Fang Muyang

12:21.300 --> 12:23.210
has a few words to say.

12:23.760 --> 12:25.020
Give him a round of applause.

12:34.180 --> 12:34.970
Fei Ni.

12:44.570 --> 12:45.970
I've always wanted to give you

12:46.940 --> 12:47.890
a proper wedding,

12:48.570 --> 12:49.570
so I could express

12:51.180 --> 12:52.920
how happy I am to be your husband.

12:54.330 --> 12:55.660
I hope today

12:56.490 --> 12:58.610
becomes our best memory.

13:01.848 --> 13:03.004
One of our best memories.

13:17.810 --> 13:19.330
Fang,

13:19.330 --> 13:21.570
isn't that missing something?

13:21.570 --> 13:23.850
It's your wedding day.

13:23.850 --> 13:25.100
A happy occasion.

13:25.180 --> 13:27.020
We're eating this
on a big day like this one?

13:27.020 --> 13:28.970
At least give us some wedding candy.

13:28.970 --> 13:29.610
Am I right?

13:29.610 --> 13:30.910
- Even if there's no banquet,
- Am I right?

13:30.910 --> 13:32.070
to thank everyone

13:32.070 --> 13:33.490
for coming today,

13:33.610 --> 13:35.210
each table gets one braised fish.

13:35.210 --> 13:36.330
Fei Ni and I are treating.

13:36.940 --> 13:38.570
That's good!

13:38.850 --> 13:39.940
Braised fish?

13:40.560 --> 13:41.850
- Great!
- The fish is here!

13:41.850 --> 13:43.660
They're treating us to fish!

13:55.648 --> 13:56.850
Come on, let's eat the fish.

13:57.180 --> 13:57.660
Ni.

13:57.780 --> 13:58.570
Ting.

13:59.300 --> 14:00.610
That's huge.

14:00.610 --> 14:01.810
Good.

14:02.730 --> 14:03.970
The fish

14:03.970 --> 14:05.530
tastes amazing.

14:05.530 --> 14:06.100
Fei Ni.

14:08.900 --> 14:10.210
Look how touched you are.

14:11.330 --> 14:12.610
Say a few words.

14:13.210 --> 14:14.610
Everyone, quiet.

14:14.780 --> 14:16.330
Fei Ni is going to speak.

14:20.300 --> 14:21.140
I...

14:21.300 --> 14:23.020
I really didn't expect

14:24.000 --> 14:24.960
Fang Muyang

14:25.640 --> 14:26.940
to secretly prepare

14:27.690 --> 14:28.510
braised fish...

14:28.810 --> 14:29.310
No, I mean

14:29.540 --> 14:30.420
the wedding.

14:32.140 --> 14:33.730
Seeing my coworkers...

14:34.300 --> 14:35.530
The fish is really good.

14:35.780 --> 14:37.610
You enjoy the fish so much...

14:39.570 --> 14:40.640
I'm really

14:41.810 --> 14:43.270
happy.

14:46.690 --> 14:49.020
I'm just too emotional.

14:55.300 --> 14:57.140
Fang Muyang's really something.

14:57.140 --> 14:58.970
He managed to get so many fish.

14:59.180 --> 15:00.090
It's Fei Ni.

15:00.090 --> 15:01.300
Look at Fang Muyang.

15:01.300 --> 15:02.810
He's totally under her thumb.

15:02.810 --> 15:04.570
I say, mind your own business.

15:04.570 --> 15:06.090
As long as there's food, that's enough.

15:09.330 --> 15:10.090
Captain,

15:10.690 --> 15:11.610
why aren't you eating?

15:11.850 --> 15:12.570
Yeah, Captain.

15:12.570 --> 15:13.450
Eat.

15:13.450 --> 15:14.380
Never eaten fish before?

15:14.380 --> 15:15.210
Jeez.

15:19.000 --> 15:20.380
Go on and eat.

15:22.970 --> 15:24.180
Now I get

15:24.180 --> 15:25.300
why they bought a bunk bed.

15:25.810 --> 15:26.730
The newlyweds

15:26.730 --> 15:28.420
just want to stick together
all the time.

15:28.610 --> 15:31.020
They even sleep all cuddled up.

15:32.380 --> 15:33.090
Chief Wang,

15:33.610 --> 15:34.970
what do you mean by a bunk bed?

15:36.271 --> 15:38.315
When Fei Ni and Fang Muyang
first moved in,

15:38.337 --> 15:39.210
I thought

15:39.330 --> 15:40.300
I'd go greet

15:40.300 --> 15:41.380
the new neighbors.

15:41.940 --> 15:42.810
Guess what?

15:43.490 --> 15:44.690
They have

15:44.730 --> 15:46.490
a bunk bed in the room.

15:47.020 --> 15:49.020
What kind of newlyweds sleep like this?

15:49.540 --> 15:50.570
They said

15:50.626 --> 15:52.271
the top bunk was for storage

15:52.293 --> 15:53.710
and the bottom bunk for sleeping.

15:53.804 --> 15:55.960
The bottom bunk was small.
They could actually fit in?

15:56.140 --> 15:58.080
Young newlyweds have their ways.

15:58.093 --> 15:59.160
They must be very in love.

16:01.660 --> 16:03.200
(When our comrades encounter hardship,)

16:03.200 --> 16:04.804
(we must deliver results,
see the light,)

16:04.804 --> 16:05.700
(and steel our courage.)

16:08.900 --> 16:10.060
I'm exhausted today.

16:20.570 --> 16:21.570
Get up.

16:22.420 --> 16:23.540
I'm tired.

16:24.540 --> 16:26.020
Can we talk tomorrow?

16:28.130 --> 16:29.610
How much did the fish cost?

16:36.780 --> 16:37.420
60.

16:41.780 --> 16:43.210
Where did you get that much money?

16:47.260 --> 16:47.900
I...

16:49.060 --> 16:50.140
I took yours.

17:14.580 --> 17:16.210
I just wanted to make you happy

17:17.010 --> 17:18.180
and wanted your parents

17:20.100 --> 17:21.580
to be proud

17:23.493 --> 17:24.737
in front of your coworkers.

17:26.620 --> 17:28.210
I planned to catch the fish myself,

17:28.580 --> 17:29.820
but I really couldn't,

17:30.530 --> 17:31.620
so I thought

17:33.530 --> 17:35.180
I'd borrow your money.

17:45.970 --> 17:47.050
I've planned it out.

17:47.093 --> 17:49.315
The training program gives me
fifteen yuan a month.

17:49.900 --> 17:51.690
I'll have a formal job
in two months.

17:58.210 --> 18:00.180
Do you know what I saved that money for?

18:12.420 --> 18:12.870
Fei Ni.

18:12.870 --> 18:13.770
Don't follow me.

18:23.820 --> 18:24.890
Thank you, Mr. Gao.

18:26.700 --> 18:29.100
(Educated Youth Office)

18:29.100 --> 18:30.290
Did Mr. Gao say yes?

18:30.650 --> 18:31.180
No.

18:32.382 --> 18:33.900
Then what are you thanking him for?

18:34.100 --> 18:35.380
Mr. Gao encouraged me.

18:35.420 --> 18:37.915
He said I did excellent work
at the Educated Youth Station.

18:38.770 --> 18:40.340
What's that even worth?

18:40.360 --> 18:42.604
If you're so excellent,
why won't he assign you a job?

18:43.970 --> 18:45.530
Anyone can just heap on the praise.

18:45.826 --> 18:47.250
- I'll talk to him.
- Don't go.

18:47.490 --> 18:48.050
Lin Mei,

18:48.530 --> 18:50.130
there aren't many job openings now.

18:50.182 --> 18:51.620
The leaders are in a tough spot.

18:51.690 --> 18:53.180
And you're not?

18:53.420 --> 18:54.330
You think for them,

18:54.330 --> 18:55.448
but who's thinking for you?

18:55.940 --> 18:58.399
So? The Educated Youth Office
walks all over an honest man?

18:58.400 --> 18:58.970
Lower your voice.

18:58.970 --> 19:01.380
You went to the toughest place,
worked in the farm for the longest,

19:01.380 --> 19:02.970
and now they won't
even assign you a job?

19:02.970 --> 19:03.900
Why?

19:03.900 --> 19:04.810
What's their problem?

19:13.820 --> 19:14.420
Lin Mei,

19:14.730 --> 19:16.210
don't be anxious.

19:16.530 --> 19:17.300
I'm not.

19:17.582 --> 19:19.140
You're not anxious. Why should I be?

19:19.970 --> 19:22.180
I'm anxious. I am.

19:22.970 --> 19:23.730
I know

19:23.730 --> 19:25.180
you mean well.

19:27.730 --> 19:28.940
I'm not doing this for you.

19:29.140 --> 19:30.380
I'm doing it for myself.

19:33.380 --> 19:35.690
I want to marry a man I love.

19:35.900 --> 19:37.530
I want that man to live steadily,

19:37.530 --> 19:38.580
smoothly.

19:38.970 --> 19:40.620
Don't always think of others.

19:40.626 --> 19:42.490
You should sometimes
think of yourself too.

19:43.620 --> 19:44.490
Yes,

19:44.490 --> 19:46.420
socialist youth
should dedicate themselves.

19:46.620 --> 19:48.100
But it can't be only that.

19:48.480 --> 19:49.729
Do you know what they say about

19:49.730 --> 19:50.970
job placements
for educated youths now?

19:50.970 --> 19:52.850
If you've got connections,
they value connections.

19:52.850 --> 19:54.404
If you don't, they look at your temper.

19:54.426 --> 19:56.620
Whoever makes the biggest fuss
gets assigned first.

20:00.210 --> 20:00.740
I know.

20:04.210 --> 20:05.210
Sometimes I feel like

20:06.140 --> 20:07.350
dating you

20:07.690 --> 20:08.970
is like fighting a war.

20:09.690 --> 20:11.620
First, you refused to come back.

20:12.080 --> 20:14.010
Now you're finally back,

20:14.382 --> 20:15.620
but you don't have a house.

20:16.290 --> 20:17.850
Fei Ni did everything she could

20:18.100 --> 20:19.110
to get assigned a place

20:19.110 --> 20:19.970
and move out.

20:20.290 --> 20:21.820
And you won't even fight for a job.

20:22.426 --> 20:24.690
It feels as if I fought warlords,
then the Japanese,

20:24.970 --> 20:27.180
then the Nationalist reactionaries.

20:27.210 --> 20:29.293
The whole Chinese people
already stood up in pride,

20:29.340 --> 20:31.290
and I still can't get married.

20:31.900 --> 20:33.340
No, don't say that.

20:33.730 --> 20:34.420
Lin Mei,

20:35.140 --> 20:35.900
I promise

20:36.380 --> 20:37.690
I'll find a job myself.

20:38.140 --> 20:39.210
Where?

20:39.620 --> 20:41.360
From who? Who's going to help you?

20:41.360 --> 20:43.580
If you won't go make a fuss
at the Educated Youth Office,

20:43.580 --> 20:45.580
you'll be a social youth forever.

20:51.380 --> 20:51.960
Fei Ting.

20:55.490 --> 20:56.770
If you can't secure a job,

20:57.730 --> 20:58.890
even if my mom agrees,

21:01.040 --> 21:02.180
I won't marry you.

21:03.100 --> 21:03.600
Lin Mei.

21:13.500 --> 21:16.340
(Quotations from President Mao:
The Chinese have ambition and ability.)

21:16.340 --> 21:17.540
(We will catch up with and surpass
the advanced world.)

21:17.730 --> 21:18.620
Come, Tengda.

21:18.620 --> 21:19.470
Eat some chicken.

21:19.470 --> 21:20.020
(Wang Tengda)

21:20.180 --> 21:21.550
No need to watch for Mr. Lin.

21:21.550 --> 21:23.300
He suddenly switched shifts
with a coworker.

21:23.770 --> 21:25.620
But Lin Mei will be back soon.

21:25.620 --> 21:26.380
Come on.

21:26.380 --> 21:27.420
- Eat.
- My sister will be right back.

21:27.420 --> 21:27.940
Let's drink.

21:27.940 --> 21:28.660
- Come on.
- Let me toast you.

21:28.660 --> 21:29.530
(Lin Song)
Let me toast you.

21:29.530 --> 21:30.100
I'll finish it.

21:30.100 --> 21:30.680
Don't.

21:34.660 --> 21:35.580
Lin Mei's back.

21:36.180 --> 21:36.870
You're home.

21:37.490 --> 21:38.730
- Come.
- Come.

21:39.620 --> 21:40.730
Let me introduce you.

21:40.826 --> 21:42.026
This is my sister, Lin Mei.

21:42.048 --> 21:44.100
She works at the
Supply and Marketing Cooperative.

21:44.290 --> 21:45.900
This is Wang Tengda.

21:46.940 --> 21:48.290
He works at Transport Team Two.

21:50.140 --> 21:50.680
Um...

21:56.820 --> 21:57.620
Well.

21:59.420 --> 22:01.080
Lin Mei, hello.

22:02.210 --> 22:03.820
Wang Tengda, hello.

22:04.404 --> 22:05.820
- Come on and have a seat.
- Sit.

22:05.820 --> 22:06.670
- Tengda.
- Sit.

22:06.880 --> 22:07.370
Sit.

22:12.050 --> 22:14.530
His whole family works
in the transport fleet.

22:15.010 --> 22:16.650
His father's a leader there.

22:16.982 --> 22:18.100
You two can have a good chat.

22:22.050 --> 22:22.660
Tengda,

22:23.140 --> 22:23.970
let me toast you.

22:25.450 --> 22:26.040
Sure.

22:39.920 --> 22:41.040
Tengda, eat the dishes.

22:41.820 --> 22:42.510
Eat the dishes.

22:43.210 --> 22:43.970
Tengda,

22:44.990 --> 22:46.170
since we're making friends,

22:46.540 --> 22:48.140
I want to talk about something personal.

22:49.210 --> 22:50.210
Yes, of course.

22:50.210 --> 22:52.140
- Friends should talk heart to heart.
- Right.

22:52.140 --> 22:53.160
Be sincere to each other.

22:54.450 --> 22:54.970
Come on.

23:01.930 --> 23:02.560
Drink it.

23:15.970 --> 23:17.620
Look, my boyfriend

23:18.140 --> 23:19.070
is such a blockhead.

23:19.070 --> 23:20.690
I can't understand.

23:20.900 --> 23:22.000
Drink less.

23:22.000 --> 23:22.690
You...

23:22.690 --> 23:23.760
You're talking nonsense.

23:23.760 --> 23:24.530
No boyfriend.

23:24.530 --> 23:26.800
She doesn't have a boyfriend.
Well, you see.

23:26.800 --> 23:27.730
No.

23:39.140 --> 23:41.010
Look, you people with connections

23:41.610 --> 23:43.140
all get assigned to good jobs.

23:43.940 --> 23:44.670
My boyfriend

23:45.170 --> 23:46.380
is very capable,

23:46.680 --> 23:48.070
but he can't get a good job.

23:49.380 --> 23:50.290
Is that fair?

23:50.490 --> 23:51.520
Well,

23:53.180 --> 23:53.820
Mrs. Lin,

23:54.210 --> 23:54.770
Lin Song.

23:56.140 --> 23:57.700
I just remembered

23:58.490 --> 24:00.140
there's something at the fleet tonight.

24:00.140 --> 24:00.770
I should

24:01.820 --> 24:02.420
get going.

24:02.420 --> 24:03.350
Don't go.

24:03.620 --> 24:04.940
- Tengda, don't go.
- Tengda.

24:04.940 --> 24:06.293
- Tengda.
- Not drinking anymore?

24:06.770 --> 24:07.840
About the job...

24:08.190 --> 24:09.340
Mom, look at what she's done.

24:09.340 --> 24:10.510
Tengda!

24:11.380 --> 24:11.980
Tengda!

24:12.970 --> 24:13.860
All you know is drink.

24:13.860 --> 24:15.350
Stop drinking. Jeez.

24:15.730 --> 24:16.530
What's wrong?

24:16.937 --> 24:18.940
Didn't you tell me
to make friends with him?

24:19.290 --> 24:21.100
I told him my troubles.

24:21.100 --> 24:22.970
I've never told anyone except Fei Ni.

24:24.290 --> 24:26.210
I was sincere.

24:27.820 --> 24:28.620
You!

24:29.530 --> 24:31.820
How did I give birth
to someone like you?

24:36.490 --> 24:38.580
Stop eating.

24:40.290 --> 24:41.900
Stop eating!

24:42.210 --> 24:44.100
How can you even eat?

25:24.450 --> 25:25.280
Where did you go?

26:10.100 --> 26:12.250
I know you saved that money for college.

26:13.770 --> 26:14.400
I'm sorry.

26:19.490 --> 26:20.730
I won't do that again.

26:29.940 --> 26:31.060
Please forgive me.

26:42.490 --> 26:44.290
You haven't changed at all.

26:45.860 --> 26:46.660
Fine, I accept it.

26:48.970 --> 26:51.140
I'm the one
who insisted on this marriage.

26:53.290 --> 26:55.450
I'm the one who took half this house.

26:57.490 --> 26:58.340
It's all me.

27:00.690 --> 27:01.490
It's okay.

27:02.100 --> 27:03.580
Money can be earned again.

27:03.970 --> 27:05.490
I've got plenty of time, anyway.

27:06.100 --> 27:08.140
I can't go to college this year, anyway.

28:20.680 --> 28:21.790
(I can't marry you.)

28:22.448 --> 28:24.315
(There are many things
that can't be changed.)

28:24.770 --> 28:26.010
Maybe we were never

28:26.070 --> 28:27.490
meant to be.

28:27.560 --> 28:29.515
How can people
from different backgrounds

28:29.582 --> 28:30.900
fall in love?

28:35.040 --> 28:37.210
(Did you accept my proposal
because you love me?)

28:37.690 --> 28:39.060
(Didn't you just want to escape)

28:39.060 --> 28:40.290
(your family?)

28:40.970 --> 28:44.340
(How much of your desperation
is actually love?)

28:57.180 --> 28:57.940
Who is it?

29:00.390 --> 29:01.680
It's not 10 PM.

29:12.250 --> 29:13.210
I thought it over

29:14.100 --> 29:15.460
and checked out.

29:16.160 --> 29:18.226
There's no point in wasting
the national resources.

29:43.340 --> 29:44.380
Can you stop reading

29:45.660 --> 29:46.900
and look at your husband?

29:55.140 --> 29:55.840
(Fang Mujing,)

29:56.370 --> 29:57.480
(will you marry me?)

29:58.100 --> 29:58.940
(What a small world.)

29:59.230 --> 29:59.940
(Yeah.)

30:00.340 --> 30:01.250
I'm her husband.

30:01.270 --> 30:03.004
(Marriage Certificate)
Can I interfere now?

30:03.320 --> 30:04.250
(I'm very happy)

30:04.580 --> 30:05.860
(and honored)

30:06.140 --> 30:07.900
(to marry Fang Muyang's sister,)

30:07.900 --> 30:09.690
(Fang Mujing.)

30:24.380 --> 30:25.290
Qu Hua,

30:25.760 --> 30:27.530
can two people
from different backgrounds

30:28.290 --> 30:29.960
fall in love?

30:40.900 --> 30:42.010
Why not?

31:03.210 --> 31:04.190
Have a bite.

31:04.360 --> 31:05.737
It just came out of the pot.

31:22.640 --> 31:24.620
I used to have no one
to worry about but myself.

31:27.340 --> 31:28.690
I never thought about tomorrow.

31:29.860 --> 31:31.660
I always felt there was nothing wrong

31:32.620 --> 31:33.730
with living like that.

31:36.530 --> 31:38.290
So I naturally assumed

31:39.530 --> 31:40.900
everyone should live that way.

31:42.900 --> 31:44.730
My world used to have only me in it.

31:45.530 --> 31:46.530
No one else.

31:54.140 --> 31:55.290
But now I have you.

31:57.250 --> 31:58.420
I have a family.

32:01.620 --> 32:02.690
From now on,

32:04.900 --> 32:06.290
I can't keep acting recklessly.

32:08.140 --> 32:09.660
And I shouldn't use my way of thinking

32:11.420 --> 32:12.420
to replace yours.

32:19.010 --> 32:19.380
Fei Ni.

32:22.100 --> 32:23.340
I formally apologize.

32:24.050 --> 32:25.010
I held a wedding

32:25.137 --> 32:26.515
without discussing it with you.

32:27.010 --> 32:28.900
I used your money
without your permission.

32:31.460 --> 32:32.140
I was wrong.

32:36.530 --> 32:37.900
Please forgive me this once.

32:43.530 --> 32:44.250
Fang Muyang.

32:47.140 --> 32:47.940
I know.

32:49.940 --> 32:51.970
I know your intention was good.

32:53.450 --> 32:54.970
But what you did

32:56.010 --> 32:57.450
isn't what I wanted.

32:58.250 --> 33:00.290
Next time you do something like this,

33:00.660 --> 33:02.620
can you talk to me first?

33:03.660 --> 33:04.690
Compared to surprises,

33:06.140 --> 33:07.420
I'm more afraid of shocks.

33:08.900 --> 33:09.730
I promise you.

33:11.660 --> 33:13.290
From now on, I'll listen to you

33:13.820 --> 33:14.660
about everything.

33:16.620 --> 33:17.860
Really?

33:19.940 --> 33:21.250
Then I punish you

33:22.760 --> 33:25.093
for holding paper boxes with me
for three months.

33:25.900 --> 33:26.460
Sure.

33:28.871 --> 33:31.010
Can you teach me
how to crochet these mesh bags?

33:42.620 --> 33:43.410
Have you eaten?

33:46.471 --> 33:48.271
Get a pair of chopsticks.
We'll eat together.

33:54.626 --> 33:56.004
From now on, leave the job

33:56.210 --> 33:57.620
like pasting the boxes

33:57.940 --> 33:58.660
to me.

34:03.100 --> 34:03.790
Eat this.

34:48.050 --> 34:50.260
Send these to Ms. Ma
at the printing factory,

34:50.260 --> 34:51.860
then hurry to your training program.

34:52.010 --> 34:52.860
Don't worry.

34:53.940 --> 34:56.380
I can pedal a tricycle just like a bike.

34:58.450 --> 35:00.420
We rented this tricycle.

35:00.530 --> 35:02.220
Remember to give Ms. Ma 0.1 yuan.

35:02.315 --> 35:04.260
You can't earn a few cents
folding all night.

35:04.420 --> 35:05.780
Don't rent the tricycle next time.

35:05.780 --> 35:07.130
I'll carry it back on my bike.

35:07.740 --> 35:09.010
Look at you.

35:09.010 --> 35:10.130
You've learned to save money.

35:10.340 --> 35:11.970
That's because of your good teaching.

35:13.450 --> 35:14.080
Fang Muyang.

35:16.420 --> 35:17.030
Mujing.

35:17.520 --> 35:18.060
Hua.

35:18.450 --> 35:19.830
Mujing, Hua,

35:20.050 --> 35:21.050
want to come upstairs?

35:21.220 --> 35:23.420
No. I have to head back
to Jiangnan this afternoon.

35:23.420 --> 35:25.380
Just came to see you before leaving.

35:27.010 --> 35:27.760
Brown sugar cakes.

35:28.220 --> 35:29.170
You're the best.

35:30.860 --> 35:32.490
She said your head injury

35:32.490 --> 35:33.340
hasn't fully healed.

35:33.450 --> 35:35.520
If you need anything, come to Jiangnan.

35:35.740 --> 35:36.848
I'll examine you properly.

35:37.160 --> 35:37.940
No thanks.

35:38.420 --> 35:39.200
I'm fine.

35:42.380 --> 35:43.780
I was pretending.

35:44.540 --> 35:45.740
I was afraid once I got better,

35:45.740 --> 35:47.315
Fei Ni wouldn't take care of me anymore.

35:47.420 --> 35:49.680
He confessed the night we registered.

35:50.220 --> 35:51.420
Mujing was right.

35:51.860 --> 35:53.610
She said you were clever

35:53.610 --> 35:54.871
and mischievous as a child.

35:54.893 --> 35:55.860
She's pretty objective.

35:58.130 --> 35:58.650
Fei Ni,

35:59.420 --> 36:00.740
take this money

36:01.220 --> 36:02.650
and buy yourselves something nice.

36:02.860 --> 36:04.050
Just a little something

36:04.050 --> 36:05.160
from me as your sister.

36:05.970 --> 36:06.610
Mujing,

36:06.610 --> 36:08.170
we can't take this.

36:08.170 --> 36:09.970
We'll figure out the furniture
ourselves.

36:09.970 --> 36:11.420
- I'm working...
- Thank you.

36:12.004 --> 36:13.671
- Fang Muyang.
- That's a great help.

36:15.610 --> 36:16.820
You don't know my sister.

36:16.893 --> 36:19.204
She won't change it
once she has made up her mind.

36:21.050 --> 36:21.780
Dear,

36:22.340 --> 36:23.130
keep the money.

36:26.650 --> 36:27.700
Thank you, Mujing.

36:27.700 --> 36:28.650
I should go now.

36:28.650 --> 36:29.700
We need to catch the train.

36:29.700 --> 36:30.010
Sure.

36:31.360 --> 36:33.340
If anything comes up,
come to Jiangnan to find me.

36:33.340 --> 36:33.860
OK, Hua.

36:34.426 --> 36:35.271
We're leaving.

36:38.050 --> 36:38.860
I'm leaving, too.

36:41.130 --> 36:42.050
Keep the money.

36:42.190 --> 36:42.860
I know.

36:43.610 --> 36:45.130
Don't forget the 0.1 yuan for Ms. Ma.

36:51.220 --> 36:52.220
Be careful.

36:55.650 --> 36:57.380
Fei Ni, you haven't gone to work yet?

36:57.380 --> 36:58.760
I'm going back to grab my bag.

37:02.940 --> 37:03.900
Chief Wang,

37:03.937 --> 37:05.020
are you heading to work?

37:05.048 --> 37:05.970
Good morning, Fei Ni.

37:05.970 --> 37:06.780
Wait for me.

37:06.780 --> 37:08.220
Let's go together.

37:09.260 --> 37:10.570
I'm not riding my bike.

37:10.570 --> 37:11.450
I'm taking the bus.

37:11.450 --> 37:13.570
My tire blew out.

37:13.820 --> 37:15.050
Give me a second.

37:17.160 --> 37:18.410
We'll take the bus together.

37:18.700 --> 37:19.240
Sure.

37:19.700 --> 37:20.240
Let's go.

37:21.060 --> 37:23.050
Here's your stop.

37:23.050 --> 37:33.220
(Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory)

37:45.970 --> 37:46.860
Chief Wang,

37:47.170 --> 37:50.340
I heard Ms. Chen from
the Publicity Division is retiring soon.

37:50.610 --> 37:51.820
Who's taking over?

37:52.650 --> 37:53.820
Her two kids,

37:54.010 --> 37:55.170
one joined the army,

37:55.226 --> 37:57.530
the other took her husband's job
at the restaurant.

37:58.450 --> 37:59.420
Once she leaves,

37:59.420 --> 38:01.050
the post will be vacant.

38:01.060 --> 38:02.750
It's heavy work
in the Publicity Division.

38:02.760 --> 38:04.220
She's going off to enjoy retirement.

38:04.626 --> 38:06.450
I still have to figure out
who'll replace her.

38:07.130 --> 38:09.860
What are the recruitment requirements?

38:09.970 --> 38:10.860
Nothing special.

38:10.970 --> 38:12.220
We open recruitment to everyone.

38:12.360 --> 38:13.220
They must be patriotic

38:13.220 --> 38:14.050
and love the people.

38:14.315 --> 38:16.050
The "Black Five Categories" won't pass.
[*Classifications of political identity and social status]

38:16.050 --> 38:17.420
Ms. Xu wouldn't approve.

38:18.940 --> 38:19.940
Chief Wang,

38:21.050 --> 38:24.050
my brother was very active
when he was at the farm.

38:24.130 --> 38:25.130
He's honest

38:25.130 --> 38:26.170
and hardworking.

38:26.170 --> 38:27.530
Do you think he would qualify?

38:28.860 --> 38:30.380
It's not impossible.

38:31.780 --> 38:32.530
But Fei Ni,

38:32.860 --> 38:34.640
someone from the Light Industry Bureau

38:34.640 --> 38:36.090
already asked me to keep an eye out.

38:36.130 --> 38:37.570
They wanted to recommend a relative.

38:39.740 --> 38:40.610
They even promised

38:40.610 --> 38:42.220
they could get me a television coupon.

38:43.260 --> 38:44.170
You know

38:44.170 --> 38:46.860
my husband has been wanting a telly.

38:47.170 --> 38:48.450
We've almost saved enough money.

38:48.650 --> 38:50.260
We just need the coupon.

38:55.820 --> 38:57.130
But in my heart,

38:57.170 --> 38:58.780
I still prefer to keep this position

38:58.820 --> 39:00.626
for a family member
of our fellow coworkers.

39:00.740 --> 39:02.170
After all, we're our own people.

39:02.170 --> 39:03.530
So I never agreed.

39:06.220 --> 39:07.230
Chief Wang,

39:07.570 --> 39:09.220
how about this?

39:10.420 --> 39:13.280
Ms. Chen retires next month.

39:13.530 --> 39:14.650
Give me some time.

39:14.650 --> 39:15.650
I'll think of something.

39:15.650 --> 39:16.530
I'll try

39:16.940 --> 39:18.720
to get you a television coupon.

39:20.010 --> 39:21.050
Don't say it like that.

39:21.050 --> 39:22.260
I didn't ask you for one.

39:22.610 --> 39:23.300
Of course not.

39:24.010 --> 39:25.340
I'm doing this for my brother.

39:25.450 --> 39:26.130
Well,

39:26.610 --> 39:27.740
then it's settled.

39:28.820 --> 39:29.860
But hurry.

39:29.960 --> 39:31.448
A lot of people are eyeing this spot.

39:31.530 --> 39:32.170
Understood.

39:36.900 --> 39:38.130
(Jiangcheng Educated Youth Office)

39:38.130 --> 39:39.050
We've reviewed

39:39.050 --> 39:40.170
your situation.

39:40.170 --> 39:41.340
Go home and wait for the news.

39:41.570 --> 39:42.537
Thank you, Mr. Gao.

40:00.610 --> 40:01.670
Fei Ting,

40:02.220 --> 40:04.010
didn't I tell you

40:04.010 --> 40:04.780
not to rush

40:04.780 --> 40:06.010
the job matter?

40:06.130 --> 40:07.570
Yes, Mr. Gao.

40:07.940 --> 40:08.560
I'm not rushing.

40:08.860 --> 40:09.610
I can wait.

40:10.780 --> 40:12.630
But you can't wait here like this.

40:13.240 --> 40:14.870
It doesn't look good.

40:18.260 --> 40:19.340
Fei Ting,

40:19.340 --> 40:21.380
you're a senior.

40:21.380 --> 40:22.940
You should set an example.

40:22.940 --> 40:24.420
You can't hang around here.

40:28.570 --> 40:29.200
Mr. Gao,

40:29.337 --> 40:31.260
I know the office
isn't having it easy either.

40:31.600 --> 40:33.100
But I don't have anything to do.

40:33.260 --> 40:34.050
How about this?

40:34.170 --> 40:34.920
If there's any work

40:35.220 --> 40:36.570
at the office

40:36.570 --> 40:37.510
that I can help with,

40:37.610 --> 40:38.260
I'm willing.

40:38.610 --> 40:39.050
Uh...

41:01.220 --> 41:02.340
You mean

41:02.530 --> 41:03.970
any job?

41:05.220 --> 41:05.780
Yes.

41:07.970 --> 41:09.050
There is one place

41:09.050 --> 41:10.130
you could try.

41:10.940 --> 41:11.520
Where?

41:13.248 --> 41:14.340
(Jiancheng City Milk Station)

41:14.340 --> 41:15.490
What's going on?

41:16.010 --> 41:16.860
I'm happy.

41:16.860 --> 41:17.450
What happened?

41:17.450 --> 41:18.970
Payday's coming up.

41:18.970 --> 41:19.780
Of course I'm happy.

41:19.780 --> 41:20.740
Look.

41:20.940 --> 41:22.610
Does it have a bigger size

41:22.610 --> 41:23.900
in the town commune?

41:24.050 --> 41:25.010
Yes.

41:25.010 --> 41:27.040
You're not even fat. There must be one.

41:28.430 --> 41:29.650
I don't wear that big.

41:30.780 --> 41:31.650
No problem.

41:34.130 --> 41:35.130
Young lad,

41:35.220 --> 41:36.940
push the brush all the way in,

41:37.190 --> 41:38.700
so you reach the corners.

41:39.610 --> 41:40.610
Show me.

41:41.940 --> 41:42.580
That's right.

41:42.860 --> 41:44.380
Young lad, you're sharp.

41:45.960 --> 41:47.050
Do you have a girlfriend?

41:47.610 --> 41:49.820
What's your name?

41:49.820 --> 41:50.820
How old are you?

41:51.260 --> 41:53.260
I have a niece. She's twenty.

41:53.260 --> 41:54.380
She's single.

41:54.530 --> 41:55.860
My name is Fei Ting.

41:56.380 --> 41:58.260
I've had a girlfriend for three years.

41:58.380 --> 41:59.671
We're preparing to get married.

42:00.220 --> 42:01.050
What a shame.

42:01.380 --> 42:02.260
Fei,

42:02.260 --> 42:03.300
if you meet

42:03.300 --> 42:04.420
any good young man,

42:04.420 --> 42:06.050
remember to tell me.

42:06.940 --> 42:08.090
Tell you

42:08.090 --> 42:09.420
or your niece?

42:10.300 --> 42:11.260
My bad.

42:11.260 --> 42:12.570
It's my niece.

42:12.570 --> 42:13.340
Fei,

42:13.340 --> 42:14.770
Ms. Sun has taken a liking to you.

42:15.340 --> 42:17.300
Look at her. Don't tease him.

42:18.610 --> 42:19.570
You know what, Fei?

42:19.610 --> 42:20.780
When Ms. Sun was young,

42:20.780 --> 42:22.130
she was truly a beauty.

42:22.130 --> 42:23.050
Look at her big eyes,

42:23.050 --> 42:24.380
red lips, and high nose bridge.

42:24.380 --> 42:24.970
Right?

42:25.650 --> 42:26.610
I was very pretty

42:26.610 --> 42:27.940
when I was young.

42:28.820 --> 42:31.860
(Women)

42:31.860 --> 42:34.490
Gao Hua, can I get my soap back?

42:41.820 --> 42:42.530
Ms. Liu,

42:42.860 --> 42:44.220
your skin is flawless.

42:44.650 --> 42:45.580
If I didn't know better,

42:45.580 --> 42:47.380
I'd think you were only
in your twenties.

42:51.650 --> 42:52.590
Fei Ni,

42:52.782 --> 42:53.848
since you got married,

42:53.893 --> 42:56.240
you've become quite the smooth talker.

42:56.570 --> 42:58.130
I'm telling the truth.

43:01.310 --> 43:01.970
Ms. Liu,

43:02.760 --> 43:05.360
I heard your younger brother
works at the Commerce Bureau.

43:05.610 --> 43:06.170
Yes.

43:06.248 --> 43:07.537
He was just assigned there.

43:07.860 --> 43:08.450
Why?

43:09.740 --> 43:12.780
Could he get a television coupon?

43:28.860 --> 43:33.340
♪After the laughter, I think of you♪

43:35.900 --> 43:40.620
♪After the storm, I think of you♪

43:43.140 --> 43:49.260
♪In the little courtyard,
there you are dancing♪

43:50.260 --> 43:54.820
♪That earnest you,
smiling so innocently♪

43:57.300 --> 44:02.060
♪In spring, I stay by your side♪

44:04.500 --> 44:08.860
♪When summer comes, I watch over you♪

44:11.220 --> 44:17.860
♪In the light of dawn, you belong to me♪

44:17.860 --> 44:27.460
♪At the edge of the world,
I will still hold you tight♪

44:28.540 --> 44:34.700
♪There is a small place♪

44:34.700 --> 44:41.500
♪Where they carry big dreams♪

44:41.500 --> 44:48.860
♪Every lovely face♪

44:49.740 --> 44:55.900
♪Shines brightly in the heart♪

44:56.700 --> 45:02.740
♪Even when we collide,
we hold our course♪

45:03.940 --> 45:09.740
♪Even when we stumble,
we keep our resolve♪

45:10.820 --> 45:17.100
♪My you, walking toward the distance♪

45:17.900 --> 45:26.140
♪Please carry our dreams
and let them soar♪
